{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちはるーむへようこそ(﹡ˆ ˆ﹡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブログのコメントが未だに増えていて\nこんなに見てくれている方がいるのだと、\n驚きと共に嬉しさを感じました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"時間はかかるかもしれないけど\n私なりに前へ進んでいきたいと思います！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメント全てが私の励みであり\n私の力になります。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に皆さんありがとうございます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まずは笑顔で過ごすこと。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブログの更新もするので皆さんよかったら\nこれからも見に来てください♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"-------------------------♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この前の握手会の時に、真夏と\n「首の長さ比べ」してみたよ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「首の長さ比べ」って...！！笑\nネーミングセンス問われそう...(> <)笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここは川後Pにネーミングセンス頂いてくるしかないな...笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"比べてみた結果がこちら！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/07/14/2585319/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/07/14/2585319/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"......どう？？笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"少しだけ私の方が長い気もするけど\n正直よく分からないよねヽ(；；)丿笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"同じ服装で、同じ髪型にして、\n誰かメンバーに撮ってもらうのが\n早い気がする( ◦˙ ˙◦ )笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初めからそうすればよかったね( ◦˙ ˙◦ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ということで！\nまた「首の長さ比べ」したいと思います〜♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"-------------------------♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そろそろコーナーをちゃんと決めたい！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と思って、全部ルーズリーフに書き出しているんだけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はまだまだ終わりそうにないから\nまた明日決定するね〜(> <)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お待たせしてしまって申し訳ない(> <)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"((因みに今のところ\n\"ファッションコーナー\" が人気だよ♡))"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"-------------------------♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/07/14/2585319/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でこっぱち。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ずーっと疑問なんだけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私のおでこって広い？狭い？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分では広いと思っていたら\nまいちゅんには「狭いよ！」と言われたり。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんはどっちだと思う(_ _).｡o○？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"